{
    "id": "WinterBlackoutWizard",
    "title": "Winter Power Outage Coordinator",
    "description": "Step-by-step decision tree for immediate actions when power fails in freezing temperatures.",
    "steps": [
        {
            "id": "current_conditions",
            "prompt": "What is the current status?",
            "type": "form",
            "fields": [
                {
                    "name": "indoor_temp",
                    "label": "Indoor Temperature (°F)",
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 65
                },
                {
                    "name": "outdoor_temp",
                    "label": "Outdoor Temperature (°F)",
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 32
                },
                {
                    "name": "so_far",
                    "label": "Hours Power Has Been Out",
                    "type": "number",
                    "default": 1
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "heat_zone",
            "prompt": "Select your 'Warm Room' (The smallest, most insulated room).",
            "type": "single-select",
            "options": [
                {
                    "label": "Living Room (Central, Fireplace)",
                    "value": "living"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Bedroom (Small, South Facing)",
                    "value": "bedroom"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Basement (Insulated, No Windows)",
                    "value": "basement"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "people_count",
            "prompt": "Who is present? (Body heat math)",
            "type": "number",
            "label": "Total People + Pets",
            "default": 2
        },
        {
            "id": "pipe_risk",
            "prompt": "Are you worried about pipes freezing?",
            "type": "single-select",
            "options": [
                {
                    "label": "Yes, it is < 32°F outside.",
                    "value": "risk_high",
                    "next": "pipe_action"
                },
                {
                    "label": "No, it is > 40°F.",
                    "value": "risk_low",
                    "next": "food_check"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "pipe_action",
            "prompt": "Pipe Protection Protocol:",
            "type": "checklist",
            "options": [
                {
                    "label": "Turn OFF Main Water Valve.",
                    "value": "main_off"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Open lowest faucet to drain system.",
                    "value": "drain_low"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Open all upper faucets.",
                    "value": "open_high"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "food_check",
            "prompt": "Food Preservation Strategy",
            "type": "instruction",
            "text": "If Outage > 4 hours, move Perishables (Milk/Meat) to: Outside (if freezing) or Unheated Garage (if < 40°F)."
        },
        {
            "id": "safe_heat_sources",
            "prompt": "What Safe Heat sources do you have?",
            "type": "multi-select",
            "options": [
                {
                    "label": "Wood Stove / Fireplace (Vented)",
                    "value": "chem_wood"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Propane Heater (Mr. Buddy - Indoor Safe)",
                    "value": "chem_propane"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Gas Stove (Oven)",
                    "value": "unsafe_oven"
                },
                {
                    "label": "Just Blankets / Body Heat",
                    "value": "passive"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "oven_warning",
            "condition": "contains safe_heat_sources 'unsafe_oven'",
            "prompt": "DANGER WARNING",
            "type": "alert",
            "text": "NEVER use a gas oven for heat. Carbon Monoxide poisoning is odorless and fatal. Use blankets instead."
        }
    ],
    "outputs": [
        {
            "type": "markdown_plan",
            "template": "# Winter Survival Action Plan\n\n## 1. The Strategy\n- **Warm Room:** {{heat_zone}}\n- **Target Temp:** Maintain > 50°F using {{people_count}} people's body heat.\n- **Instruction:** Seal this room. Hang blankets over doors/windows. Pitch a tent inside if possible.\n\n## 2. Infrastructure\n{{#if (eq pipe_risk 'risk_high')}}\n- [x] **Water Main:** OFF\n- [x] **Pipes:** Drained\n{{else}}\n- **Pipes:** Monitor temp. If indoor drops < 45°F, drain pipes immediately.\n{{/if}}\n\n## 3. Safety Check\n- **CO Monitor:** Ensure batteries are working if using {{safe_heat_sources}}.\n- **Sleep:** Wear a hat. Sleep elevated off the floor.",
            "includes_checklists": true
        }
    ]
}